Looking at the current code, I need to apply double buffering to overlap the load phase of tile k+1 with the compute phase of tile k. I'll create ping-pong buffers for `local_y1`, `local_A1`, `local_y2`, and `local_A2`, alternating between them on each j_tile iteration.

